    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DEEP DOWN is a dark but cute card game about emotional unpacking,<br><br>Your world is overrun by boxes that pile up and accumulate, filled with cards representing your repressed emotions. Empty those boxes and confront the painful memories that hold you back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/db6534f88e1bb469845448af1c530243.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>Play cards in verbal encounters with a multitude of characters whose personalities affect the nature of the cards they play. Match their cards to restore your relationship with them and receive more consideration from what they play. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/db1154a2ef15684ea56b3f31bc70acb2.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>Cards convey your emotions. They transform as the discussion progresses and their effects are modified according to their emotional charge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/793d458978dfe74e69c3a17aab45a816.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/793d458978dfe74e69c3a17aab45a816.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/793d458978dfe74e69c3a17aab45a816.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/8e52b63cadab6330d73a1a3694e06133.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>The consequences of the cards you play and the choices you make during events persist and affect the way the characters interact with you and others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/361092ed7bdea34d24485b9e77bae217.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/361092ed7bdea34d24485b9e77bae217.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/361092ed7bdea34d24485b9e77bae217.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/e658f8ebd77e91f6a0d79f1d06d42a87.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>Cards are created at the end of each encounter, representing what has been expressed during the conversation. The cards that are left behind, are repressed and will be used against you later.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/050fb69b65b07d9df25ca7873539660b.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/050fb69b65b07d9df25ca7873539660b.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/050fb69b65b07d9df25ca7873539660b.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/29f90ef2b4dcfdbc7f368e3de857e43e.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>A mysterious shadow guards these memories and prevents you from going too far, becoming increasingly menacing the closer you get to your goal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/e89e10e5b7452fefc3ba302faa05af2d.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/e89e10e5b7452fefc3ba302faa05af2d.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/e89e10e5b7452fefc3ba302faa05af2d.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/c39e4e64cea1ba4ee7b5045bf467c1e0.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>As you unpack your boxes, unlock parts of yourself that will make you feel more empowered. Use these new skills to defeat the many forms of the shadow that infiltrates your nights. Put an end to this cycle of helplessness!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>\ud83d\udfe3 A wide variety of characters, whose distinct personalities are reflected in the nature of their cards and the way they are played.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Emotion cards come in a variety of forms and their effects change as their emotional charge varies, creating hundreds of variations.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Numerous abilities that help you create synergies within your deck.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Multiples intimate stories about the character's past as you unpack boxes filled with memories.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 An exploration of the various dimensions of anxiety-depressive disorders through different videogame representations ranging from perceptual artifacts to direct impacts on gameplay.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 An expressive visual treatment that matches and adapts to the anguish and fragmentation of the main character.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/09e39d5956f9d44dd759e9d391840102.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DEEP DOWN is a dark but cute card game about emotional unpacking,<br><br>Your world is overrun by boxes that pile up and accumulate, filled with cards representing your repressed emotions. Empty those boxes and confront the painful memories that hold you back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/db6534f88e1bb469845448af1c530243.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>Play cards in verbal encounters with a multitude of characters whose personalities affect the nature of the cards they play. Match their cards to restore your relationship with them and receive more consideration from what they play. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/a5021871ce4f0fcde803da812f0cf3dc.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src