cea1ba4ee7b5045bf467c1e0.avif?t=1711381606\" /></span><br>As you unpack your boxes, unlock parts of yourself that will make you feel more empowered. Use these new skills to defeat the many forms of the shadow that infiltrates your nights. Put an end to this cycle of helplessness!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.poster.avif?t=1711381606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.webm?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427940/extras/d3725b7cb18545ed8ba449905beee5be.mp4?t=1711381606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>\ud83d\udfe3 A wide variety of characters, whose distinct personalities are reflected in the nature of their cards and the way they are played.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Emotion cards come in a variety of forms and their effects change as their emotional charge varies, creating hundreds of variations.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Numerous abilities that help you create synergies within your deck.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Multiples intimate stories about the character's past as you unpack boxes filled with memories.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 An exploration of the various dimensions of anxiety-depressive disorders through different videogame representations ranging from perceptual artifacts to direct impacts on gameplay.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 An expressive visual treatment that matches and adapts to the anguish and fragmentation of the main character.<br><br>",
